&lt;p&gt;In the CALIPSO-Fire meeting, I shared maps of roads and burned area. I got some comments such as 1) add road vs non-road in addition to burned vs. unburned, 2) to set hypotheses and create relevant plots, 3) to consider buffers around roads as people move, and 4) to consider other attributes like land cover type and population size. Chunhui also gave the same comment as 1).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
