      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/20250126_jena_wk229/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;이번-주는&#34;&gt;이번 주는&amp;hellip;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;vegpp_eval revision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;thesis writing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Almost finished the revision. Only left is to finalize the latex file, hopefully.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;2024-01-24-금요일&#34;&gt;2024. 01. 24. 금요일&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
  &lt;thead&gt;
